{"title": "尼采哲学经典（套装共5册）", "index": 7, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_\"><img class=\"calibre_10\" id=\"filepos13969\" src=\"images/00053.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">瑞士巴塞尔大学外景</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_13\" src=\"images/00057.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">就读于普福塔高等学校时的尼采（16岁）</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_14\" src=\"images/00092.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">德国哲学家尼采（1844—1900）</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_15\" src=\"images/00083.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">尼采15岁时写给母亲的书信手迹</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_16\" src=\"images/00118.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">莱比锡大学</span></p><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_20\" src=\"images/00009.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_21\" src=\"images/00116.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  尼采的父亲  </span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  尼采的母亲  </span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_22\" src=\"images/00049.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_22\" src=\"images/00005.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  尼采的妹妹伊丽莎白  </span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  尼采的红粉知己莎乐美  </span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_23\" src=\"images/00033.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_23\" src=\"images/00034.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  尼采的墓，德国莱比锡西南洛肯小镇教堂墓地  </span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  尼采曾就读的普福塔高等学校  </span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_24\" src=\"images/00110.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_24\" src=\"images/00020.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  深刻影响尼采的德国哲学家叔本华（1788—1860）  </span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  瓦格纳夫妇  </span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre_2\"><img class=\"calibre_25\" src=\"images/00044.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">尼采的推崇者德国哲学家海德格尔（1889—1976）</span></p><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_26\" src=\"images/00096.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_26\" src=\"images/00066.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  尼采的知音布兰德斯  </span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  任教巴塞尔大学时的尼采  </span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre_2\"><img class=\"calibre_27\" src=\"images/00025.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">晚年的尼采（1895年）</span></p><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_26\" src=\"images/00037.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_26\" src=\"images/00065.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  青年时代的尼采（1873年）  </span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">  一身戎装的尼采  </span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre_2\"><img class=\"calibre_28\" src=\"images/00122.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">尼采用过的打字机</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_29\" src=\"images/00036.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">尼采出生的洛肯镇牧师馆</span></p><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_6\"></div>\n</body>"}]}